=> Why Playbooks Are Important in Real DevOps

Imagine a company has:

10 web servers

You need to install Apache and deploy the same webpage on all 10 servers.

a) Without Ansible:

SSH server 1 → install
SSH server 2 → install
SSH server 3 → install
...
SSH server 10 → install

b) With Ansible:

Inventory
   ↓
10 servers


Playbook
   ↓
Install Apache
Copy webpage
   ↓
10 servers

One playbook can automate the work.
